  - Name: "Note_Consult1"
    Class: "ALeonHorrorNote"
    GUID: "ba6bb68e6d4d6f965f1af39d3b3d28cf"
    Properties:
      Text: "Patient 14 no longer responds to his name. Reflexes exaggerated, pupils fixed.\\nHe does not sleep. He stands at the door of the ward and listens.\\nSedation has no effect at any dose. Recommend transfer. No reply from the county."
